{
  "about": [
    "Field facts for src/main/pasteTarget.js, with the answer each must get (bench/copy-popup.js).",
    "windows.recorded: Get-FieldFacts from the real inject.ps1 on Windows 11 (build 26200), 2026-10-19, run on elements",
    "found without moving the focus: the windows open on that PC (read-only UI Automation walks) and test windows",
    "(WinForms, WPF) that were never activated, off screen. The foreground fields (win, proc, fg) are the element's own",
    "top-level window, as they would be with that element focused. Class names that were web page classes are shortened.",
    "The test windows ran inside powershell.exe, a terminal's process name (which alone makes an answer 'unknown'), so",
    "where a test window stands for an ordinary app its proc/eproc read 'someapp'; everything else is as recorded.",
    "windows.shapes: elements that were not open on that PC, written in the same shape from what those apps expose",
    "(not recorded). mac: macOS Accessibility shapes (role, subrole, AXValue settable, bundle, web engine) as",
    "mac/inject-helper.js fieldFacts returns them, written from Apple's AX roles; not recorded on a Mac."
  ],
